-- Managed by Ansible (roles/hyprland). Local edits are overwritten.
--
-- Ported from darthtrevino/temu-omarchy. Differences from upstream:
--   * the terminal is a role variable (wezterm here, kitty upstream)
--   * the btop "Activity" and CLIamp bindings are dropped
